<title>UK: WestLB sets 500 mln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets 500 mln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE CURACAO</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE  AMT    500 MLN CZK   COUPON     14.50 PCT MATURITY    28.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    28 JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+    DENOMS(K) 25-250-2.5(M) SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   *ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.1</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		*GERMAN LAW ON THE NOTES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
